.TH CRUNCH_SET_THREAD_AREA 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_set_thread_area \- invokes syscall slot 205 with a raw descriptor; this legacy i386 interface is unimplemented on linux x86-64
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_extra.h>
.B int crunch_set_thread_area(void* descriptor);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes syscall slot 205 with a raw descriptor; this legacy i386 interface is unimplemented on Linux x86-64. Seccomp or other policy may instead return a different error.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR set_thread_area (2)
